  "description": "Pop Art Comic Blast Seamless Digital Paper Collection features 27 high-resolution seamless patterns inspired by bold comic book graphics, retro pop art, dynamic explosions, colorful geometric shapes, halftone textures, playful symbols, and energetic comic-style typography.\nThe collection features vibrant hot pink, electric blue, bright yellow, vivid green, orange, purple, black, and white tones. Designs include comic speech bubbles, starbursts, lightning bolts, hearts, stars, pizza slices, cassette tapes, explosive shapes, halftone dots, and playful comic expressions such as POW, BOOM, OMG, and other graphic elements.\nPerfect for scrapbooking, digital planners, stationery, apparel, sublimation, stickers, wrapping paper, party decorations, invitations, fabric and textile design, packaging, printable crafts, backgrounds, posters, cards, and other creative projects.\nFeatures:\n– 27 unique seamless digital paper patterns\n– High-resolution JPG files\n– 300 DPI\n– Bold retro pop art aesthetic\n– Comic book inspired graphics\n– Vibrant neon-inspired color palette\n– Halftone and graphic textures\n– Explosive shapes, stars, hearts, lightning, and comic elements\n– Fun and energetic designs\n– Seamless repeating patterns\n– Suitable for digital and print projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Pop Art Comic Blast Seamless Digital Paper Collection features 27 high-resolution seamless patterns inspired by bold comic book graphics, retro pop art, dynamic explosions, colorful geometric shapes, halftone textures, playful symbols, and energetic comic-style typography.</p>\n<p>The collection features vibrant hot pink, electric blue, bright yellow, vivid green, orange, purple, black, and white tones. Designs include comic speech bubbles, starbursts, lightning bolts, hearts, stars, pizza slices, cassette tapes, explosive shapes, halftone dots, and playful comic expressions such as POW, BOOM, OMG, and other graphic elements.</p>\n<p>Perfect for scrapbooking, digital planners, stationery, apparel, sublimation, stickers, wrapping paper, party decorations, invitations, fabric and textile design, packaging, printable crafts, backgrounds, posters, cards, and other creative projects.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n– 27 unique seamless digital paper patterns<br>\n– High-resolution JPG files<br>\n– 300 DPI<br>\n– Bold retro pop art aesthetic<br>\n– Comic book inspired graphics<br>\n– Vibrant neon-inspired color palette<br>\n– Halftone and graphic textures<br>\n– Explosive shapes, stars, hearts, lightning, and comic elements<br>\n– Fun and energetic designs<br>\n– Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n– Suitable for digital and print projects</p>",
